ADDITIONAL DISCLAIMER (not part of the AGPL text)

Nothing in this repository is financial advice. It places no orders, signs no
transactions, and holds no funds. Every number it produces is a measurement of
CURRENT state at a stated timestamp, not a forecast. See README.md.
